          basic: 'Bid when you have good trump and point cards; avoid overbidding.',
          intermediate: 'Count trumps and key cards; adjust bidding and play.',
          advanced: 'Partnership signaling and endplay; near-optimal bidding and defense.',
          tips: [
            'Bidder may not put point cards in the nest.',
            'If first three pass, dealer must bid 100.',
